Description: Keep print monitoring compatible with Android before API 29
 The embedding app supports API 24 and creates this monitor in Application.onCreate.
 FileObserver(File,int) was added in API 29, so construction aborts startup on older
 devices. The String constructor is available since API 1 and observes the same
 directory and CLOSE_WRITE events on every supported Android version.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Flat Headset Android compatibility work
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-02

--- a/client/Android/Studio/freeRDPCore/src/main/java/com/freerdp/freerdpcore/presentation/PrintJobMonitor.java
+++ b/client/Android/Studio/freeRDPCore/src/main/java/com/freerdp/freerdpcore/presentation/PrintJobMonitor.java
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
 
 	public PrintJobMonitor(Listener listener)
 	{
-		super(new File(WATCH_DIR), CLOSE_WRITE);
+		super(WATCH_DIR, CLOSE_WRITE);
 		this.listener = listener;
 	}
 
